" width=\"635\" colspan=\"5\" height=\"24\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">※ 납부기간내에 미등록자는 별도의 통보없이 합격 취소하고 차순위자 선발함. </span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"635\" colspan=\"5\" height=\"24\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;★ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">오름생활관 합격자는 신청할 수 없습니다.</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">➡ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">개사기간 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"> 2010. 2. 27(토) ～ 6. 18(월) - 112 일간</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">➡ 합격자 확인 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">원스톱서비스에 로그인하여 합격 여부 확인 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">➡ 납부고지서 출력 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">원스톱서비스에 로그인하여 출력</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">➡ 납부장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">농협중앙회 전국지점(단위농협 포함) 및 학교 농협</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">※ 주의사항&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">공용 PC실을 이용할 경우 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">ActiveX를 다운받아 설치</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">하여야만 신청페이지가 실행되오니 PC자체설정 권한을 Administrator로 설정하여 반드시 ActiveX를 다운로드 받아 이용하시기 바랍니다.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">※ 공용PC실의 경우 반드시 PC 관리자 확인 바람)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">※ 학번이 부여되지 않은 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">대학원 신입생</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">은 생활관 행정실에서 2010. 1. 4(월)～1. 6(수)까지 신청</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">(오름, 기존 구분)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">바라며, 합격자는 생활관비 고지서를 생활관 행정실에서 수령하여 은행에 납부 하여 주십시요</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">➡ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">생활관</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">장 추천대상자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">〔서류제출자도 인터넷 접수(</span><a href=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">www.kumoh.ac.kr</span></a><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"> 원스톱서비스)를 신청해야 함〕</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">생활관장</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">의 추천을 받고자 하는 학생은 그 내용을 증명할 수 있는 아래 서류를 2009.&nbsp;&nbsp; 12. 21(월)～12. 24(목)까지 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">생활관 행정실(오름, 기존 구분)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"> 로 제출</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">•</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">제출서류(다음 각호 1에 해당하는 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">서류와 주민등록등본 1통)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;① 국민기초생활보장법에 의한 수급자증명서</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;② 소년․소녀가장(세대원)증명서</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;③ 장애인 증명서</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;④ 국가유공자(유족)확인원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 6pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">➡ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">입사 대상자 제출서류</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">미제출자는 퇴사조치 함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">생활관을 입사하는 전 관생은</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;①</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">결핵</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"> 및 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">B형 간염</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"> 2가지만</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">검진한 검사결과서(소견서) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;② </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">주민등록등본 1부</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">(오름관 입사자는 제외)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">위의 2가지 서류는 입관전(학기 개시일전)까지 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">생활관 행정실(오름, 기존 구분)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">로 제출하여야 합니다(우편제출 가능) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">※ 간염검사에서 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">항원이 양성일 경우</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"> 내과병원에서 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">활동성 내지 비활동성 인지</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">를 추가로 검사한 결과서를 제출하여야 함.</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">비활동성 보균자는 입관할 수 있음</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 6pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">➡</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"> E-Village 선발자도 인터넷 접수(</span><a href=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">www.kumoh.ac.kr</span></a><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"> 원스톱서비스)를 신청해야 함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">➡ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">서류 제출처 주소</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;730-701&nbsp;경북 구미시 산호로 77번지 금오공과대학교 생활관 행정실&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">➡</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"> 2010-1학기 입주일자 : 2010. 2. 27(토) 14 : 00 ～ 2010. 3. 1(월)&nbsp;<br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><br>➡</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;호실 배정표&nbsp;: 2010. 2. 27(토) 생활관 게